{ TYPE_CHECKING

? Static type checkers must treat `typeing.TYPE_CHECKING` as `True`.

 `typing.TYPE_CHECKING` will be deprecated.

  See also PEP 781 (Make `TYPE_CHECKING` a built-in constant)
